"Old Greyhand is a treant of Level 60, and no Wrenmark foe could fell him before the blight."
"He has rooted himself across the Hollow's door and is drinking its blight to hold it in."
"The blight is killing him slowly; he has perhaps a month before he turns."
"A turned Old Greyhand would be a blighted treant of Level 60, far beyond Nala now."
"He cannot speak, but a hand on his bark lets a mage feel what he feels."
"Purifying him before the Hollow is cleansed only buys days; cleansing the core saves him."
